  <name>PentaGrammata</name>
  <summary>Morse code copying practice</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.fuszenecker">
    <name>Róbert Fuszenecker</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      PentaGrammata plays random five-character groups, callsigns, cities, names, abbreviations or your own text
      as Morse code with Farnsworth timing, and checks what you copied.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every session is scored and saved, and the trends and correlation charts show how your speed and accuracy
      develop. The speed can adjust itself to your error rate.
    </p>
  </description>
